      "statement": "The explicit form-to-bulletin implementation link is HO 01 04 T.57, which directs that its provision be applied as required by CDI-2022-03 B.2; because T.57 is in the windstorm-and-hail section, it does not itself create earthquake coverage or prove that the offer, affirmative authorization, or filing was completed.",
